Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why does this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.51,0:00:01.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,guardrail end peel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.95,0:00:02.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,into a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.23,0:00:02.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel ribbon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.32,0:00:03.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,Because a plain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:04.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,rail end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:04.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,does this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.27,0:00:06.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,It spears right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:06.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,into the cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.19,0:00:07.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.63,0:00:08.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,gets a steel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:09.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,head that slides
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.08,0:00:09.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,down the rail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:11.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Inside, it squeezes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:12.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,the rail flat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:12.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,and bends
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:13.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:14.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Crushing steel takes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:15.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,a huge force,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:16.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,and that force
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.59,0:00:17.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,slows the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:18.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,The posts snap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:19.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,off, so nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:20.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,snags the wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.87,0:00:21.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sixty to zero
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.83,0:00:22.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,in about two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:23.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,car lengths, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:24.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,the cabin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:25.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,is untouched.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.52,0:00:26.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,So next time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:26.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,you pass a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.51,0:00:27.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,yellow guardrail head,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.97,0:00:28.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,you know what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:28.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,it is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.53,0:00:29.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,waiting for.
